  "$comment": "Behaviour freeze for the Actana Studio Knowledge Base engine (plan 14, TASK-001). Plain JSON, relative document paths, no Studio code required to read it. The Search repo copies this file byte for byte. Regenerate expectations with KB_FIXTURE_RECORD=1 (see fixtures/README.md) — never hand-edit expectedTop5. There is deliberately no timestamp in this file so a re-record diff shows only what the engine actually did.",
  "fixtureVersion": 1,
  "embedder": {
    "kind": "hash-ngram",
    "dims": 256,
    "version": 1,
    "spec": "lowercase, split on [^a-z0-9]+, unigrams then bigrams joined with '_', FNV-1a 32-bit per gram, bucket = hash % 256, sign = -1 when bit 31 is set else +1, accumulate, L2 normalise; an all-zero accumulator stays all zero",
    "reference": "apps/actana/lib/kb/testing/hash-ngram-embedder.ts"
  },
  "keywordExtractor": {
    "kind": "deterministic-frequency",
    "version": 1,
    "spec": "lowercase, split on [^a-z0-9]+, keep only tokens in the fixed topic vocabulary, sort by count desc then token asc, take the first N; the list is bounded under 100 so Studio's query-time keyword menu (EXISTING_KEYWORDS_TOP_N) never truncates it",
